<% content_for :title, "About - MLBB Heroes" %>

<div class="about-page">
  <h1>About MLBB Heroes App</h1>
  
  <div class="about-content">
    <h2>Data Sources</h2>
    <p>This application provides comprehensive information about Mobile Legends: Bang Bang heroes.</p>
    
    <h3>Hero Data Sources:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Mobile Legends Official Game Data</strong> - Hero statistics, roles, and abilities</li>
      <li><strong>Community Resources</strong> - Hero guides and meta information</li>
      <li><strong>API Integration</strong> - Real-time hero data from MLBB APIs</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>About This App</h2>
    <p>The MLBB Heroes app allows you to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse all Mobile Legends heroes</li>
      <li>View detailed hero information including roles, specialties, and difficulty ratings</li>
      <li>Add new heroes to the database</li>
      <li>Edit existing hero information</li>
      <li>Delete heroes from the database</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Hero Attributes</h2>
    <div class="hero-attributes">
      <h3>Roles:</h3>
      <p>Tank, Fighter, Assassin, Mage, Marksman, Support</p>
      
      <h3>Lanes:</h3>
      <p>Exp Lane, Jungle, Mid Lane, Gold Lane, Roam</p>
      
      <h3>Specialties:</h3>
      <p>Charge, Regen, Burst, Poke, Push, Support</p>
      
      <h3>Difficulty:</h3>
      <p>Rated from 1 (Easy) to 10 (Very Hard)</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="app-info">
      <h2>Technical Information</h2>
      <p>This application is built with Ruby on Rails and uses SQLite as the database.</p>
      <p>Created as part of a full-stack web development project.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="navigation-links">
    <%= link_to "View All Heroes", heroes_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
    <%= link_to "Add New Hero", new_hero_path, class: "btn btn-secondary" %>
  </div>
</div>
